>  along the left–right spectrum.
.         * For respondents who support a specific party, we assign the corresp
> onding Left–Right Ideology score (0–10) from the Chapel Hill Expert Survey (C
> HES) for the relevant period.
.         * We use the CHES values for all supported parties (when there is onl
> y one supported party), with the exception of CDU/CSU support (then we use th
> e simple average of the CDU and CSU CHE values).
.         * Respondents who do not report support for a specific party are assi
